window.products.push({"id":250007,"name":"3PCS Wardrobe Clothes Drawer Organizer for Clothing-Camiraft Washable & Foldable Closet Organizers and Storage Box Divider Closet Organizers for Jeans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u6LdLJneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👖【Washable & Easy To Clean】The wardrobe clothes organizer comes with the mesh ventilation design of environmental material ,keeping the clothes fresh. ⭐⭐⭐Warm Tips: The package is folded once received,it could be better to wash it in warm water by hand and then it can be stretched naturally and air dry, they will be more stereoscopic. For sustainable use, we suggest you to wash it by hand, if you need the machine washing; please put it in the cleaning bag. ⭐⭐⭐ 👖【Multifunctional Size】The drawer organizer for clothing has 4 size designs, which can meet all your storage needs. Pls choose the right size according to your needs. The package includes the ⭐⭐⭐1*Thin Jeans Grids 14.17*9.84*7.87inch +1*T-shirt Grids 12.6*9.84*6.6inch+1*Legging Grids 14.17*6.69*4.72'' , suitable for storing jeans, casual pants, T-shirts, thin Trousers etc. ⭐⭐⭐The video about how to fold the jeans correctly to the organizers’ slot is also provided for your reference. 👖【Quality Material】Made of mesh nylon with fine workmanship, soft seams and durability,our drawer organizer for clothing is not easy to deform and will not collapse after use. After unfolding &washing 1st time, the folding marks will not be left on its mesh material .Tips: After storing the required items, pls make sure hold them up from the bottom instead of the sides by hand so that the extreme stress on a single corner which will result in tearing, can be avoided effectively. 🧺【Saving Time and Space】The visible gird wardrobe clothes organizer makes it convenient for you to store clothes, saving time and space, which greatly improves the utilization rate of the wardrobe space. It can be used in multiple stacks and keeping your wardrobe and drawers tidy and orderly. Besides, it can be folded easily to save space when not in use. 🧺【Widely Used】The drawer Organizer for clothing is very suitable for storing underwear, socks, scarves, leggings, skirts, T-shirts, jeans, or other items. The clothes organizer can be widely used for wardrobes/closets/drawers or under the bed. There are multiple compartments for sorting and organizing your belongings and keep your living space organized. ANY PROBLEM IN USE ,FEEL FREE TO TURN TO US⭐⭐⭐Larger size suitable for extra large men’s jeans or over-sized clothes is on the way, stay tune.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u6LdLJneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camiraft","source_asin":"B09L48WJ3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L48WJ3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L48WJ3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
