window.products.push({"id":250010,"name":"Donco Kids Mission Low Slide Loft Bed White/Twin/CAMO Tent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":551.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sgl6AtgHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy watching children enthusiastically start every day with a fun slide down from the loft bed of the Donco Kids Mission Low Slide Loft Bed. Due to the lower height of this loft bed, it can be comfortably reached with the two step ladder. This makes it convenient and safe for children to use the Donco Kids twin loft bed with slide, from a relatively younger age. The clean lines and contemporary design of the Donco Kids loft bed with slide make it a fun, elegant and uber-functional addition to any children’s room. Donco Kids twin loft bed saves space and lets children use the floor as play or study areas. The loft bed also provides a usable area below the bed. In addition, the slide can be easily detached to create additional space when required. Add the optional tent on these loft beds for kids and create a private room within a room. Let Children get creative and come up with new imaginary games and stories from their personal hiding place in the loft bed tent. The solid pine wood construction using high quality material (including non-toxic lead free paint and dyes), goes through a structured multi-step process to give it a durable, sturdy and smooth finish. The slatted bed frame of this twin low loft bed is designed to support most standard mattresses. Guard rails on the loft bed are designed for added safety protecting children from rolling over. Donco Kids bed with slide is recommended for kids above six years and meets both ASTM and CPSC safety standards. Donco Kids low loft bed is available in a choice of two frame colors – White & light espresso and five style/color choices for the optional tent – Blue, CAMO, Pink, red and zebra. The tent fabric is easy to maintain and can be detached and cleaned easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sgl6AtgHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DONCO KIDS","source_asin":"B00FEYLAX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FEYLAX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FEYLAX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
