window.products.push({"id":250024,"name":"Vilano Lace, 4-Piece, 21-Inch Extra Deep Pocket Sheet Set, Premium Quality, Easy Care, Shrinkage Free Sheet Set with 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NbX3l4c+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Imported Extra Deep Pocket Sheet Sets: Are you tired of your fitted sheets not fitting properly on your mattresses and coming off?  Our fitted sheets are 21 inches deep in size.  This means they can easily fit your deep mattresses without coming off.  The all-around elastic on our fitted sheets will cover your deep luxurious mattress and any toppers easily, no matter how much you toss and turn.  These fitted sheets are premium quality and a snap to put on. We guarantee it. California King Size is a 4-Piece Set: Includes 1 Extra-Deep Pocket fully elasticized Fitted Sheet (72 in x 84in x 21 in Deep), 1 King Flat Sheet (112\" x 102\") and TWO King Pillowcases (20\" x 40\") with Beautifully Decorated Hem with Lace High Quality Craftsmanship & Signature Soft Fabric: You spend all day working hard. You deserve quality sleep in Extremely gentle, comfortable, and smooth Sheet Sets. Our Sheets are Easy Care, breathable, Light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage free and fade and resistant. Easy Care & Fade Resistant:   Our Sheets are Fade and Pilling Resistant.  They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time.  And yes, they also are Wrinkle Resistant.   These Sheet Sets are made with our Signature Top of the line quality 110 GSM (grams per square meter) Double-Brushed Luxurious microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness, while most sheets are made with 75 – 90 GSM. The Southshore Guarantee:  Our Extra-Deep Pocket Sheet Sets come with worry-free One-year Warranty.  When you Purchase a Southshore product, you become part of our family.  We offer 100% Money-Back Guarantee.  We are a customer focused brand and will do our absolute best to take care of you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NbX3l4c+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B00GEMCD30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GEMCD30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GEMCD30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250025,"name":"DHMAKER Vertical Dresser Storage Tower, Steel Frame, Wood Top, Easy Pull Textured Fabric Bins - Organizer Unit for Bedroom, Hallway, Entryway, Closets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aDHNKfB8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 DRAWER CHEST: Features 8 removable drawers; helps you sort items by type to control confusion. The vertical design fits easily in many locations throughout the home; Store and organize leggings, yoga pants, sweaters, towel, socks and more; Mix & match with other DHMAKER storage organizers to make your life tidier. STYLISH SMART STORAGE: The product can easily fit into a smaller space while still providing enough storage space; Wood top provides a hard surface to place lamps, books, alarm clock, journal, glasses, decor and more; The removable drawers have an easy pull handle to make opening and closing simple; Plastic feet will not scratch flooring, and they are adjustable for uneven surfaces EXTENSIVE APPLICATIONS: Create coordinated organization in any room of the house; Great for children, teens and adults; Use anywhere you want to add a little style to your organizational needs; This easy-to-use chest of drawers can be used in multiple rooms throughout the home; Great for closets, bedrooms, nurseries, playrooms, entryways and more; Ideal for small spaces such as apartments, condos and dorm rooms QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: The material of drawer is non-woven fabric, environmentally friendly and breathable. The product consists of a sturdy steel frame. It adds firmness and stability. Durable MDF wood top & Plastic feet protect floors. Hardware is included for hassle-free installation. WARRANTY & DIMENSIONS: The unit size of wardrobe cabinet is 31.5(L) x 11.8(W) x 32.1(H) inches, Drawer Dimension is 14.57(L) x 10.8(W) x 7(H), the unit weight of product is 24.7 lbs. If you have any problems, please let us know, we will help you solve it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aDHNKfB8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHMAKER","source_asin":"B08MWDFWPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MWDFWPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MWDFWPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250026,"name":"UMUFUKA Lunch Box for Men, Tactical Lunch Cooler Tote,Insulated Lunch Bag Adult, With Detachable MOLLE Water Bottle Pouch, Men Leakproof Lunch Bag for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XA1R2HnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spacious Men lunch bag - This lunch bag has really big capacity. It has one upgraded large extended front pocket and one side pocket with MOLLE straps and one detachable Water Bottle Pouch. Large enough for your food container, drinks, napkins and utensils. The size of this lunch box heavy duty is 10.5’’*8’’*9.5’’ which can hold about 20 can of 330ml coke equaling to 13L. Durable Oxford Material- The fabric of this lunch cooler tote is a very reliable one. You will be surprised to see how long lasting it is after a period of time’s using. Fine and smooth zipper pull will always save your time from being stuck whenever in a rush.Thickening PE foam will also make the insulation long for your shift time when you bring food to work.It retains hotness for your food for over 8 hours and keep coldness as well. Leak proof &Well Insulated&many ways to carry - We have thicken the padding and thermal insulation to prevent outer warm or cold air penetrating into the lunch bag which keeps food and drinks at constant temperature for hours.And also the inside can be pulled out over to clean easily. This lunch cooler has a long adjustable& detachable shoulder strap and reinforced grab handle.It can be simple grabbed or put around the shoulder without any extra pressure. Manhood Military MOLLE Webbing- Considerate designing of the insulated lunch box tote with 3 sides Molle webbing belt loops, a side mesh pocket, and a detachable water bottle pouch,a backside Webbing specially designed to attaching storage pouches, keys, sunglasses and baby outgoing stuff and so on.The rear part of the molle belt also makes it to be attached to your larger backpack easily. Use for more occasions: The reusable lunch bag for women/men, It can help you enjoy healthy food anywhere to go; portable and lightweight to carry - Such as the hiking, shopping, travel, camping, at the gym, for lunch to work, picnics, work, adventures to the beach and fishing etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XA1R2HnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMUFUKA","source_asin":"B0B15D7DFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B15D7DFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B15D7DFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
