window.products.push({"id":250147,"name":"Hamilton Hills Rectangular 24 Inch Thin Bar LED Vanity Lighting Fixture | Brushed Nickel Bathroom Lights Over Mirror | Warm Bright Light 3000K, 3500K ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dByJG25vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SOPHISTICATED DESIGN: A simple clean light bar offers modern design with beautiful lines and a contemporary feel. Brushed nickel finishes encapsulate a linear glass-free frosted sconce with even light distribution and exceptional color accuracy. Change between 3000K , 3500K or 4000K LED with a built in switch. LED lighting unlike harsh fluorescent or hot Halogen alternatives. Substantial annual energy savings. SAFE AND EASY TO INSTALL: Our authentic dimmable bar lights are ETL & cETL Certified for the US and Canada. Energy efficient with 50,000 hours rated lifetime. Instant on, no flicker, no UV, mercury free light. 14.5W, 1037 Lumens, 120V with 90+ CRI. Full instructions included with standard three wire install makes installation a breeze. 3 GENERATIONS OF EXCELLENCE: Our family has been manufacturing and producing household fixtures and decorative pieces for over 3 generations. We stand by the quality of our product and your experience. A family owned business with simple principles. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY: We use premium materials not found in other lesser quality imitation lights you will see. Our lights are made to strict trade-secret standards and pass a rigorous 8 point inspection. Every light comes with our certification of authenticity and are certified to nationally recognized standards for safety. Thin Rectangular Bar Modern LED Vanity light is a perfect addition to your bathroom. It is made of high-quality material, it has an excellent performance in waterproof, heatproof, and anti-corrosion. With its unique design, it will make your space more elegant. This product can be used as an over mirror or over the sink which makes it more suitable for different places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dByJG25vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Hills","source_asin":"B07P9TNLQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9TNLQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9TNLQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250148,"name":"Hyde Lane Linen Textured Neutral Window Curtains for Living Room Rustic Farmhouse Style Bedroom Drapes | Grasscloth Look with Room Darkening & Grommet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ifs+TXGCL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Polyester Casual Modern with RUSTIC CHARM: These grasscloth farmhouse curtains have a woven fabric and LINED texture that come in a plethora of color options: multi heathered in the sand and tan colors, tonal for the greys, and bold for the blacks and blues. This dynamic style can flow with almost any bedroom décor! Meaning these curtains will fit in the living room or the bedroom. Please look closely at pictures before purchase. LIGHT REDUCTION AMPLIFIES NATURE LIKE BEDROOM SETTING: Although these are not completely blackout curtains, these will enhance the evening ambiance and set the mood just right by darkening the room a bit sooner. As the sun rises, these curtains will slow the process of harsh light seeping through your bedroom, allowing you to wake up in a more natural, gradual progression. HI-DENSITY FOAM BACK: IDEAL FOR improving insulation and reducing noise from outside. If your neighbors or roadside traffic becomes a nuisance, simply close the curtains for added relief while still maintaining some ambient light. Retain more of that heat in the winter, and keep your room cool in the summer thanks to the light blocking effects. PROVEN DESIGN & EASY CARE: THESE CURTAINS ARE EXTREMELY DURABLE because of the 6 easy slide metal grommet toppers on each curtain. Hang them up in seconds and wash them easily! They’re machine washable and will last a VERY long time. NO HASSLE 30 DAY GUARANTEE–BE AMAZED, OR YOUR MONEY BACK: Our mission: create world class products that make ANY ROOM feel like “home”. We believe we’ve “EXCEEDED EXPECTATIONS”, and we expect you’ll experience the same or we’ll send you a full, instant refund. (Size options: 63”, 84”, 95” length - 40: wide and they come in a pair so total width is 80\")","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ifs+TXGCL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyde Lane","source_asin":"B082LRZ9DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082LRZ9DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082LRZ9DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
