window.products.push({"id":250404,"name":"TEEBARN Brushed Nickel Oval Bathroom Vanity Mirror 20x30 Pill Shaped Capsule Wall Mounted Mirror with Metal Frame Hangs Vertical & Horizontal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YPXB61CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brushed Nickel Oval Bathroom Mirror for Vanity: Inspired by modern aesthetics, this pill shaped oval bathroom mirror is featuring a contemporary look and functional details. The brushed nickel metal frame which would protect the mirror and create elegance for a bathroom . Fully sealed frame design makes the mirror more stable and longer working life. Stainless Steel Metal Frame: This sturdy modern bathroom mirror features with premium quality stainless steel metal frame. Finished in electro-plated technique (compared to others in powder coating), our mirrors won't be rusted and moisture safe. Simply completes an expensive looking and be your focal point to any of your rooms. Dimensions and Colors: Weighs 14lbs! Overall: 20”x30”x1”. This wall mounted mirror is a good choice to decor your bathroom, living room, bedroom, gallery wall, entryway and etc. Available in 4 colors for you reference: matte black, gold, brushed nickel and chrome. High Quality Materials: Our modern oval wall mirror constructed with no distortion HD glass which is protected by the surrounding stainless steel metal frame. 9mm thick TSCA certified anti-corrosion backboard to prevents corrosion in humid environment. All in all , this bathroom mirror providing a high environmental adaptability and longer service life. Easy to Hang: Our excellent design allows the oval mirror to be hung horizontally and vertically. The pre-installed hooks help you install it quickly and safety. All in all, everything is included to hang this arched wall mirror.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YPXB61CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEEBARN","source_asin":"B0BTCMYP3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCMYP3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTCMYP3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250405,"name":"Rustic Quilt Sets King Size,Lodge Cabin Bedding Sets Moose Bear Print Bedspread Coverlets Stitched Bedcover Wildlife Printed Bed Set Woodland Patchwor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W8iNuj8GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【MOOSE PRINT QUILT SET】: The moose print quilt set King size includes 1 quilt and 2 king size pillow shams. King size quilt measures 96”x 108”. King size pillow sham measures 20” x 36”+2” . Multi -size choice for you to choose, suitable for kids and adults of all ages. ❤【UNIQUE DESIGN BEDDING】: Reversible lodge bedding set coverlet, multi-layer construction design with patchwork of wildlife moose bears deer bear paw pine tree leaves printed, which consist 3 separate layers carefully stitching together. Stuffed with lightweight synthetic polyester filling the quilt, lightweight coverlet bedspread, cool in summer and warm in winter. ❤【SOFT MATERIAL】: The rustic cabin bedspread set is made from top quality microfiber polyester material, double brushed on both sides for ultimate softness and comfort. Lightweight quilt, breathable and warm when sleeping. Create you an easy and comfortable sleeping experience, help you enjoy a special and peaceful family day. ❤【EASY CARE & CLEAN】: Lodge coverlet is machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low, wash separately from different colors. Fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. Soft and durable, color will not fade after washing, microfiber polyester material can keep the shape and softer after washing repeatedly. ❤【WONDERFUL BEDDING DECOR】: Decorate your bedroom, guest room, vacation home with this unique animal and plant printed bedspread coverlet, light enough to carry when you travel or go for outside activities with your family to appreciate the beauty of nature, convenient and practical , the black bear bedspread also can be a wonderful gift for weddings, birthdays, holidays and many other occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W8iNuj8GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHESITY","source_asin":"B09N2373PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N2373PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N2373PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
