window.products.push({"id":250455,"name":"Baxendale Iced Coffee Sleeve for Medium Sized Cups - 2 Pack - Neoprene Iced Coffee Sleeve (2 PK Medium 22-24oz, Silver & Pink Glitter)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Ywge0ZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thermal Insulated Neoprene Coffee Sleeve to Keep Your Beverages Cold - These drink coffee sleeves are made of high-density, durable 4mm thick neoprene so your drink sleeve keeps your iced drink colder for longer. Prevent Spills, Condensation, and Mess - The Baxendale and Co cup sleeve is a neoprene cup sleeve for cold drinks which reduces condensation; keeping your hands dry but your drink cold. Premium iced coffee socks with a non-slip grip and comfortable feel - the must have ice coffee accessories for any coffee lover. Durable, Eco-friendly, Washable, and Reusable Coffee Sleeve - Say goodbye to wasteful throw-away paper cup sleeves with our stylish and reusable coffee sock. Best of all, they're easy to wash with warm water and can be air-dried. Flexible Sleeve that Stretches to Fit a Variety of Cups, Bottles, and Tumblers - Our tapered design fits a variety of cups and water bottles. Take your brand name designer tumblers to the next level with these cute coffee sleeves. Compatible with Venti Starbucks, Dunkin Donuts, McDonalds and other popular brands’ coffee cups and tumblers. Pack of 2 Ice Coffee Sleeve Sleeves - Comes In Unique Styles - This 2-pack includes 2 Medium sleeves to fit 22 - 24oz drinks. You can choose from several fun and unique styles and even embroider and DIY your own custom design for the ultimate coffee cup ornament.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Ywge0ZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAXENDALE AND CO","source_asin":"B09N8NCW18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8NCW18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8NCW18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
