window.products.push({"id":250459,"name":"Masticating Juicer Attachment for KitchenAid All Models Stand Mixers,AMZCHEF Masticating Juicer, Slow Juicer Attachment for All KitchenAid Mixers, Col","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I9N00NB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍏[Ideal Juicer Attachment for KA All Models' Stand Mixers]Instead of buying the juicer machine with single function, why not get a AMZCHEF slow juicer attachment for Kitchenaid mixers, which will save your money in half and upgrade your mixer to become a juice machine.It help you separate the pomace from the juice easliy, and extracts the nutrients from the fruits and vegetables into juice. (Not created by KitchenAid Brand，not contain machine and cups) 🍑[Less Oxidation, More Nutrition] High quality food grade materials can meet your long-term family juice making and drinking needs.The upgraded spiral system - 7 segment spirals open up each cell for maximum juice yield.No need to add water like other juicer.No no need to filter the pomace manually. From now on, enjoy the pleasure of pure juice. The juice retains its original taste and flavor.Easy to enjoy different flavor juices every day with AMZCHEF fruit juicer attachment. 🍈[Easy Assembly&Usage]With AMZCHEF juicer attachment, can get your favourite juice in minutes.Whole masticating juicer attachment doesn't include any sharp blades,elders and children can safely operate.Simply attach the assembled juicer attachment to the power hub of your mixer and start juicing.Please make sure locked completely.LEVEL1&2 for soft ingredient:watermelon, orange,LEVEL3&4 for hard ingredient: carrot,apple,beets,ginger.Let's use fruits veggies to make own exclusive healthy drink. 🥬[Easy Clean & Safe] Not Dishwasher Safe. Only Hand Wash. In the case of complete disassembly, flush with water can complete most of the cleaning task, and then use the brush included to clean small parts, then you achieve a few minutes of quick cleaning.The juicer attachment doesn't contain any sharp blades, which ensures safe operation for your elders and kids. Note: For better user experience, fruits need to be cut and peeled. 🎁[Great Household Gift for Healthy Eating Lovers]The Best Gift for KitchenAid mixers' fans. When AMZCHEF Masticating Juicer Attachment meets your KA mixer together, they will be the most eye-catching protagonist in the kitchen.Help your family and friends share the joy while you enjoy fresh and healthy fruit and vegetable juices.Embrace a healthy life, just start with a glass of juice exclusively for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I9N00NB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amzchef","source_asin":"B0943Z8QDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943Z8QDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943Z8QDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
