window.products.push({"id":250463,"name":"MonbentoTM Insulated Bag Fuchsia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ODO+QcTwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the world of monbento, the brainchild of the French entrepreneur Emilie Creuzieux, brought to life through drive and perseverance. Our story Launched in 2009 & booming ever since, what are the reasons behind our modern success story? Our brand Relaxed, practical, innovative and chic, express yourself & accessorize your bento. Take monbento where you want when you want - it's as simple as style, choice and pleasure! CHIC AND PRACTICAL No worries for eating out! The MB Iso is entirely designed in neoprene, a naturally insulating material that lets you keep your meal cool. Ingenious, it contains 3 small extra waterproof pockets for your treats or maybe an ice-pack! Its original form and vibrant colours, associated with its discreet magnetic fastening, make it a resolutely elegant and functional bag. Now available from our creative minds to your home - Come & experience our food revolution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ODO+QcTwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"monbento","source_asin":"B00A2SE4JI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A2SE4JI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A2SE4JI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
