window.products.push({"id":250489,"name":"I AM The Small Boomerang Pillow, Small (Pack of 1), White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y0Z2aucvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The I AM The Small Boomerang Pillow is perfect for you, if you like to curl up in multiple positions each night! This pillow is made with a 233-thread count, 100% cotton cover and filled with our hypoallergenic premium blown Never Flat down alternative cluster fibers for comfort and firm support in any sleep position. Our Never Flat fiber technology keeps your pillow from getting flat by simply washing and fluffing it back to shape. For easy care, this pillow has a removable cover and can be machine washed and dried. This product has been filled and finished in the USA. I AM is a brand that offers great quality product at affordable pricing. We don’t believe in creating all the marketing hype. We stick to what’s important for you: Straight up information about the product, what’s inside the product and lastly, how to take care of it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y0Z2aucvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I AM","source_asin":"B09XNRS3MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XNRS3MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XNRS3MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250490,"name":"FR Furniture Rehab Recliner Mechanism Locking Spring 3 3/8 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FoP8vG5QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 3/8 inch short hook spring Replacement spring for your Recliner Mechanism Mechanism assist / lock / tension spring Solid metal construction Perfect repair & replacement part","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FoP8vG5QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FR","source_asin":"B00EKWU4SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EKWU4SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EKWU4SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250491,"name":"ACOMOPACK Weighted Blanket (48\"x78\" 15lbs, Pink) Silky Weighted Blanket Heavy Blanket Premium Material with Glass Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RxN-p9JbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A weighted blanket is exactly what the name indicates. It's a blanket that has additional weight added to it. While that may seem odd, those weights are incredibly useful. Their purpose is to provide deep pressure when draped over the shoulders or lap or when covering the body in bed. According to the science behind that, weighted blankets use deep pressure to provide the user with a comfortable effect. Various Ways: You can lay the weighted blanket across the lap, wrap around the shoulders when you read, relax or sleep. It's also one of the best choices as a gift for your family members and friends. Warm Reminder: 1. The weighted blanket is a breathable one due to the unique technologies so it boosts better temperature control than others. But it may also feel hot for hot sleepers in warm days due to its weight, so a fan or an AC is recommended in summer. In cold days just add a quilted duvet cover which can add warmth & snug feeling. 2. A weighted blanket would small than same size ordinary blanket because it is supposed to cover your body other than your bed. Please be rest assured it is correct size when you see a twin/queen weighted blanket is smaller than anticipated. It is OK when a weighted blanket can barely cover the mattress. 3. For the first few nights, you may feel it is too heavy or too lightweight. Getting used to a weighted blanket takes about 2-7 days, please bear with the magic weighted blanket a few more days. Care Instruction: Protect your weighted blanket from direct sources of heat, as heat could damage the glass pellets inside. If damage in the weighted blanket, discontinue use immediately until a repair or replacement can be made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RxN-p9JbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACOMOPACK","source_asin":"B088WDFCHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088WDFCHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088WDFCHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
