window.products.push({"id":250518,"name":"CANDWAX Green Taper Candles Pack of 12 - Straight Candles 10 inch Ideal as Unscented Candles, Dinner Candles and Table Candles - Slow Burning Candles ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-66jaA2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Consistently high quality: We make our straight taper candles with love and using only the best materials. Candwax skinny taper candles are made from 100% paraffin wax and will suit ideal as household candles for any candle holders. Natural cotton wick allows green candlesticks to avoid the release of harmful substances. Each of long lasting candles is hand-made making it unique, so our 10 inch taper candles will give you a pleasant atmosphere of coziness in your home. Would be perfect for any occasion: No matter what kind of event you want to celebrate - our straight candles will suit ideal as wedding day candle, Hannakuh candle, Christmas candle, Thanksgiving taper candles, emergency candles or just simple dinner candles. Green taper candles have a universal 10 inch size and impressive burning time of 9 hours. We try to make incredible candles sticks that can make you happy! Perfect home decoration: Create your ideal home interior with 12 pack candles taper! Unscented candles add some warmth and inscrutability to your house, help you relax, forget about long hard day and give you sense of appeasement. What can be more universal than Candwax dripless taper candles - green candles will be suitable for any interior and color, also tall candlesticks make each conversation exactable! Let your home become comfortable with long burning candles. The maximum usability: Have you ever bought dripless candles or smokeless candles? Our taper candles green combine those qualities! Our craftsmen make these straight candlesticks with special technology than allows to avoid drip, smoke and allow for slow burning candles. So at the final stage you can enjoy a perfect flame of tapered candles. Interesting story of creation: Our green taper candles production is located in the center of Europe. We found abandoned church and rearranged it for tall candles manufacture, where our craftsmen work manually over each candle stick. We are proud of our history, so we vouch for the quality of our tapered candles dripless. It’s important for us to make stick candles green as well as we can and even better!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-66jaA2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANDWAX","source_asin":"B0BKQWJW19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKQWJW19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKQWJW19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
