window.products.push({"id":250557,"name":"Rectangular Non Slip Serving Tray with Handles That are Easy to Grip Silicone Nubs Non Skid Plastic Food Tray - Portable Dinner Trays for Eating - Ant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TX06FjBZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DRINKS AND DISHES WON'T SLIDE AND SPILL. Our nonslip serving tray with handles is a perfect option to use as bed trays for eating, breakfast in bed tray, tv dinner lap tray and more. The plastic tray has secured silicone nubs on the top surface that grip plates, glasses, dishes to prevent them from slipping and sliding. The bottom has a non-slip silicone grid to prevent tray from slipping on bed or lap. The serving tray measures 16.25\" L x 11.5\" W x 1.25\" H. LESS MESS, LESS STRESS. Whether you are looking for a small breakfast tray, eating trays for living room, or for food trays the couch, this anti slip tray will also let you enjoy the party while serving food and drinks. This lightweight tray is great for parties and get togethers where you don’t have time to worry about spill cleanup or broken dishes and glasses. IDEAL FOR INDOOR AND OUTDOOR DINING. This handy and portable plastic serving tray is ideal for indoor dinner or outdoor parties and events. Serving foods and drinks would be a lot easier using our non skid food tray. The rubber top and bottom silicone grid will prevent the glassware and other food and drink wares from ending up on the floor making it a useful dining accessory. MULTIPURPOSE, DURABLE, AND EASY TO CLEAN. Dinner trays for eating have many other purposes aside from their basic use for serving foods. Use this dinner lap tray to set up coffee table essentials, to organize items on dressing tables or counters, or eating trays for lap. SENIORS, ADULTS, TEENS AND KIDS CAN USE WITH CONFIDENCE. Use the lightweight serving tray with confidence. The rectangle non skid rubber grip serving tray with handles that have holes which fingers can pass to make holding tray easier. Available as a dark gray or white.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TX06FjBZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Life Ideas","source_asin":"B09DRD67QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DRD67QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DRD67QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
