window.products.push({"id":250796,"name":"Copper Chef Non-Stick Square Fry Pan 5-Piece Set, 8 Inch Griddle Pan, 9.5 Inch Grill Pan, 11 Inch Griddle Pan, 9.5 Inch Lid, 11 Inch Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EJCUC0kAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Copper Chef was designed with a stainless steel induction plate that makes for perfect cooking on any surface. From electric, gas, ceramic and even induction cooktops. The CeramiTech non-stick technology, which is PTFE Free, means nothing will stick. Cook without butter, oil, or chemicals. The riveted handles allow for high heat and is heat resistant up to 850 degrees. Set includes - 8\" Griddle Pan, 11\" Griddle, 9.5\" Grill Pan, 9.5\" Glass Lid, 11\" Glass Lid. The Stainless Steel Induction Plate means no hot spots. Allowing for fast, even cooking. Ceramitech non-stick coating allows for easy clean up. It is also dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EJCUC0kAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copper Chef","source_asin":"B072PYSXK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072PYSXK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072PYSXK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":250797,"name":"Flash Furniture Louis 14 Inch Metal Platform Bed Frame with 12 Inch Pocket Spring Mattress in a Box (No Box Spring Required) - Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":488.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KoZyAEV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you need a new bed set, but you don't want to go out shopping for furniture or hassle with getting it home from the store, just take the easy route and have everything delivered right to your door. This platform bed frame with mattress included has everything you need for a great nights sleep and you never have to leave home. Quality and convenience are essential for the modern lifestyle and this bed frame foundation with mattress set features a 14\" freestanding metal platform bed frame offering 12.5 inches of clearance for storage and ease of cleaning. Constructed from 19 gauge solid steel with reinforced metal screw construction this frame will support up to 650 pounds. Solid steel slats hold the included 12\" foam and pocket spring mattress without sagging and does not require a box spring. The lack of a headboard or footboard streamlines any sleep space and will lend vertical real estate to smaller bedrooms. Last, but definitely not least, this complete bed set bundle gives you the mattress of your dreams. This medium-firm mattress features individually wrapped pocket spring coils for exceptional support to alleviate pressure points and reduced motion transfer to help you stay asleep. The foam is CertiPUR-US Certified so it's free from heavy metals, phthalates, BPDE, formaldehyde and has reduced VOCs. Arriving compressed and boxed for ease of movement, this traditional mattress will fully expand with 48 to 72 hours. Give yourself the gift of better sleep and a new look for your bedroom with the touch of a button when you order this complete mattress and bed frame set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KoZyAEV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B08Z654FQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z654FQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z654FQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
