window.products.push({"id":250856,"name":"Ucan Compost Food Bin with 4 Boxes of Untrash Bags, Glossy Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515r5s4KYUL._AC_SL1258_.jpg","description":"The team at Ucan believes in a world where sustainable products that help the earth can also be well designed. This compact, easy to use, kitchen compost bin is meant to separate food waste from trash and minimize odor with its concealed ventilation all while using our 100-Percentage compostable bags. Easy lift interior ring makes changing bags simple and sanitary. Ucan also features a simple front tab that enables the user to lift its lid with one hand, the lid stays open on its own too. Ucan's convenient carry handle stays hidden until ready for use. The bin has a sleek countertop appeal, or can be hung on the back of a cabinet. Attractive, glossy black finish with green ring and handle to compliment any kitchen. Holds approximately 2 gallons of food waste. We have provided 4 boxes of our 3 Gallon untrash bags which compliment this can perfectly. These 100-percent compostable bags hold approximately 3 gallons of food waste; 18 bags per box. Bags are tinted green and measure 17-inch by 16-inch by 2/10-inch. BPI and ASTM 6400 certified. Unlike most trash bags, the untrash bags won't break down until they reach a commercial compost facility. Ucan made of durable polypropylene 50-Percentage recycled. Designed and manufactured in USA. Measures approximately 8-6/10-inch by 9-inch by 9-1/2-inch. Ucan products four driven individuals on a mission to help others think more consciously about trash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515r5s4KYUL._AC_SL1258_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ucan","source_asin":"B009WPBW2E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009WPBW2E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009WPBW2E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
