window.products.push({"id":250985,"name":"Ameridown Light Warmth Premier Down Comforter with Sewn in Duvet Corner Loop Attachments, King/California King Size Bed, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918yS2RP4dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We spend about one-third of our lives sleeping, it's important to settle for nothing less than perfect when it comes to you and your bedding—which is why we created our AmeriDown Comforters. Ultra-soft and plush, our comforters provide the ultimate sleeping experience for twin, long twin, full, queen, king, and California king sizes. Crafted with only high-quality materials, our comforters are made with a 295 thread count brushed cotton twill downproof shell that has been certified to the Standard 100 by Oeko-Tex**, so you can enjoy a comforter that will last for years. Plus, the irritant-free 500-550 fill power down provides weightless, cozy comfort and is RDS certified***. We make our bedding products right here in the USA*, so we can ensure their superior craftsmanship. Our comforters feature 12 inch sewn-through box construction that holds the down firmly in place. The edges, which are prone to experiencing high stress and wear, are reinforced with cording and double needle stitching. Additionally, we crafted our comforters with corner loops to allow for easy duvet cover attachment and to prevent the shifting or bunching of the comforter once inside. AmeriDown Comforters are designed to be gentle and soft to the touch, yet durable enough to easily machine wash so you can enjoy a great night’s sleep, every night. *Made in a La Crosse, WI, USA manufacturing facility **Oeko-Tex Certified, 3.8.21 ***Responsible Down Standard Certified with scope certificate CU 843297RDS, 2.23.2022","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918yS2RP4dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameridown","source_asin":"B092G71Z37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-250985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092G71Z37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092G71Z37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
